    </thead><tbody>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1047547">VEX.256.F2.0F38.W0 CB 11:rrr:bbb</para>
      <para unique="1047548">VSHA512RNDS2 ymm1, ymm2, xmm3</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1047552">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1047554">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1047556">AVX</para>
      <para unique="1047557">SHA512</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1047559">Perform 2 rounds of SHA512 operation using an initial SHA512 state (C,D,G,H) from ymm1, an initial SHA512 state (A,B,E,F) from ymm2, and a pre-computed sum of the next 2 round message qwords and the corresponding round constants from xmm3, storing the updated SHA512 state (A,B,E,F) result in ymm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    </tbody>
   </table>
  </encoding_table>
